<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="549.418" endTime="578.017">
<Sync time="549.418"/>
Pos tehwa:n ne:wí:n, ke:meh i:n mohkó:n tate:mpe:wah, ta...,
<Sync time="553.963"/>
Nimitsilia *rapodarowah**, kima:yawih ma:s *cualquiera** kwowit *porque** mo tatampawiya.
<Sync time="559.021"/>
kitampawiya ne:n kahfentsi:n wa:n *como que tapodarowah** nochi, ma:s
<Sync time="562.726"/>
