<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="612.826" endTime="665.123">
<Sync time="612.826"/>
Pos *este** pané:, pané: ke:meh a:xka:n sanipa pané: *menos** a n' onkak *porque**,
<Sync time="618.741"/>
teha:n tiwehweliwkeh n' ompa ne:wí:n, a:it namehwa:n ne:wí:n ka:mpa *dios** name:chpiya ne:,
<Sync time="624.523"/>
wehwei *trozos** kwomeh, wa:lahka se: te:tsa:wyo:t, ehekat,
<Sync time="629.425"/>
